          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.5.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.5.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 5:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neyi muntu wakavulumuna, neyi wakakoŋa chuma chimu chalekesheliyi Yehova nindi chinjila kuchila, hela yena kuchiluka nehi, natanyi dehi, wakakoola kuluwa kwindi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.5.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.5.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 5:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akaleti kudi kapristu chizamba chamukoku chamwiyinda wakadi hataminayi, mundandu yindi mwomuwakamwesekela wamulambu wakutanya; kapristu akamwilili yakumubuta nachunansaŋu yachuma chanaluwiyi chakuluwukila chakubula kuchiluka, akamwanakena. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.5.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.5.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 5:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hihimulambu wakutanya, natanyi dehi chalala kumesu aYehova.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.5.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.5.19"
            ]
          }
        }
